# RhythmAlign-Research — publication ignore rules
#
# This repository publishes research RECORDS: code, methodology, reports,
# metrics, decisions, provenance. Raw media, model weights, caches and bulk
# generated artifacts stay local-only. See PUBLIC_REPO_AUDIT.md.

# ===== Environments / caches =====
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ===== OS junk =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== Secrets / credentials =====
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# ===== Media: never publish recordings or copyrighted audio/video =====
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.webm
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi

# ===== Video frame dumps =====
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# ===== Model checkpoints / pretrained weights =====
# (redistribution not cleared; see LICENSE_STATUS.md)
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.bin

# ===== Bulk numeric artifacts =====
*.npy
*.npz

# ===== Bulk working / generated directories =====
work/
checkpoints/
cache/
tmp/
temp/

# ===== Vendored third-party trees =====
# Documented by reference (README / THIRD_PARTY.md); not committed.
**/third_party/

# ===== Local-only migration inventories =====
# Full manifests contain absolute local paths / product-repo inventories.
migration/MIGRATION_MANIFEST.json
migration/.git_ignored_list.txt
